  {
   "n": 4,
   "image": "books/G1/105/p04.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 887,
   "text": "One day, a Lion was taking a nap. Soon, a little Mouse came running by. He was in a hurry to get home. The Mouse did not see the Lion. So he ran right over the Lion's nose!",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    88.17,
    94.71
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "image": "books/G1/105/p05.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 887,
   "text": "The Lion woke up with a loud roar. He grabbed the little Mouse with his big paw. \"I'M GOING TO EAT YOU!\" roared the Lion. \"YOU WOKE ME UP!\" The Lion opened his big jaws. He was going to eat the little Mouse! \"Dear Lion, please do not eat me!\" said the Mouse. \"I did not mean to wake you up. Please let me go!\"",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    96.18,
    107.64
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "image": "books/G1/105/p06.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 887,
   "text": "The little Mouse kept talking and begging. \"Dear Lion, please, please let me go! If you do, maybe one day I will help you.\" The Lion laughed at the little Mouse. He laughed so hard that he could not stop. \"You think you can help me?\" he asked. \"How could a little Mouse ever help me?\"",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    108.94,
    120.88
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "image": "books/G1/105/p07.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 887,
   "text": "\"What a funny little Mouse you are!\" said the Lion. \"I think I will let you go. I am not that hungry, anyway.\" The little Mouse was so happy! He ran off to his home. \"Thank you, dear Lion!\" he called. But the Lion did not hear him. He was still laughing too hard!",
